lass=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+13 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +13 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Attack_roll\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack</a> and <a href=\"/page/Damage_roll\" title=\"Damage roll\">damage rolls</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Echoes_of_Angdrelve\" title=\"Echoes of Angdrelve\">Echoes of Angdrelve 6</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Echoes_of_Angdrelve\" title=\"Echoes of Angdrelve\">Echoes of Angdrelve 6</a>:</b> Eager to taste the flesh of your enemies, this wicked sword drips burning acid at your command. Each strike from this devastating weapon deals an additional 6d6 Acid damage on each hit.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Wounding\" title=\"Wounding\">Wounding 3</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Wounding\" title=\"Wounding\">Wounding 3</a>:</b> This weapon saps the health from your enemies, dealing 3 Constitution damage on each hit.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Alignment_damage_(weapon)\" title=\"Alignment damage (weapon)\">Anarchic 6</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Alignment_damage_(weapon)\" title=\"Alignment damage (weapon)\">Anarchic 6</a>:</b> This weapon is chaotic and used to undermine the righteous, dealing an additional 6d6 chaos damage on each hit. This effect makes the weapon chaotic aligned. (Lawful characters wielding this weapon will suffer one <a href=\"/page/Negative_level\" title=\"Negative level\">negative level</a>.)</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Slay_Living_(enchantment)\" title=\"Slay Living (enchantment)\">Slay Living</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Slay_Living_(enchantment)\" title=\"Slay Living (enchantment)\">Slay Living</a>:</b> This weapon stores a dark and sinister power deep within. When the weapon is used, this power occasionally comes to the surface, attempting to instantly snuff out the life force of the enemy.</span></span></li>\n<li><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705465\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.orange>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Orange\"]{background-color:#F4A460;border-color:#0B5B9F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.purple>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Purple\"]{background-color:#DDA0DD;border-color:#225F22}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.green>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Green\"]{background-color:#90EE90;border-color:#6F116F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.yellow>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Yellow\"]{background-color:#EEE8AA;border-color:#111755}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.blue>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Blue\"]{background-color:#87CEFA;border-color:#783105}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.red>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Red\"]{background-color:#FA8072;border-color:#057F8D}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.colorless>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Colorless\"]{background-color:#F8F8FF;border-color:#070700}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.sun>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Sun\"]{background-color:#FFFFC0;border-color:#00003F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.moon>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Moon\"]{background-color:#C0FFFF;border-color:#3F0000}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a{border:1px solid;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 3px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.title>a{color:#003366}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.title>a:visited{color:#040050}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.tooltip::after{content:\" augments.\"}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon augment red\"><span class=\"title\"><a href=\"/page/Augment_Slot\" title=\"Augment Slot\">Red Augment Slot</a></span><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Category:Red_augments\" title=\"Category:Red augments\">Red</a> and <a href=\"/page/Category:Colorless_augments\" title=\"Category:Colorless augments\">Colorless</a></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Weapon Boost</a> +2 or +4<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Weapon Boost</a> +2 or +4:</b> +2 or +4 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Melee_Power\" title=\"Melee Power\">Melee</a>, <a href=\"/page/Ranged_Power\" title=\"Ranged Power\">Ranged</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Universal_Spell_Power\" title=\"Universal Spell Power\">Universal Spell Power</a>.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Legendary_Wave_of_Sorrow.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Legendary_Wave_of_Sorrow.png/420px-Legendary_Wave_of_Sorrow.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"601\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Legendary_Wave_of_Sorrow.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p><a href=\"/page/Schism_Shard_Crafting\" title=\"Schism Shard Crafting\">Schism Shard Crafting</a> to <a href=\"/page/Item:Reflection_of_Angdrelve\" title=\"Item:Reflection of Angdrelve\">Reflection of Angdrelve</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>The edges of this greatsword glow with a sinister purple light. Graz'zt's malevolent influence has transformed its once-mundane blade into one resembling his own.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p>This weapon can be upgraded to a legendary version with 5 Schism Shards found in <a href=\"/page/Killing_Time\" title=\"Killing Time\">Killing Time</a>.\nThere is one upgrade option: <a href=\"/page/Item:Reflection_of_Angdrelve\" title=\"Item:Reflection of Angdrelve\">Reflection of Angdrelve</a> (a Great Sword).\nThe Schism shard collector, Varron Tertius can be found in the Gatekeeper's Grove.\n</p><p><b>WARNING:</b> Any Mythic or Reaper bonuses will be lost on upgrade, and it cannot be upgraded if a sentient gem is slotted into it.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817003357\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.099 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.160 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3930/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 35814/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11323/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser functi